source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A brace form needs a non-space after it; without one the braces are literal text and the bare `*` characters inside them pair across.
-- input.jira --
a{*} b {*}c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a{<b>} b {</b>}c</p>
-- want.md --
a{**} b {**}c
-- warnings.json --
[]
